#. y1:english="Hey, {PA:10}nice to see you again, {PA:10}mister.\n...Huh?||You know him?\nWell, {PA:10}yeah.{PA:20}||I gave him some food one time.\nAre you his daughter?\nWhat...{PA:10} no...\nDo you stand here all the time?\nYeah.{PA:20}||...I'm waiting for my mother.\nYour mother?||...Is she around here?\nYeah. {PA:20}She works||in a shop somewhere around here.{PA:20}\nShe comes to pick me up late every night.\nReally...\nAre you hungry?\n...Yeah,{PA:20} a little.{PA:20}||But I'm okay today!\n...Growl...\nOops.\nTeeheehee! You sound hungry.{PA:20}\n...Come on, mister.{PA:10}||Don't you have anything to give him?\n\n\nWhat? {PA:10}Really? Thanks!||Yum yum... Yum yum...\n\nNo,{PA:10} I don't.\nAww, really?{PA:20}\nThen, {PA:10}why don't we go to||the store and get something?\nAlright.{PA:20}||...Wait here, {PA:10}kid.\nReally?{PA:10}||Wow! I'll wait right here!\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0006.BIN:120_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/RAIN_KAB0006.BIN::line:120_0_0"
msgid "Hey,{PA:10} me alegra volverle||a ver, {PA:10}señor."
msgstr ""

